+# Initial tracking delta
+
+_Last updated: 2026-10-28 15:47 UTC · Project Coordinator · scoped implementation delta._
+
+Before this work, a targeted scan of app/server source found no installed Clarity or first-party research event destination. The sole pre-existing text match was the ordinary word “amplitude” in a preview answer. This is a scoped source inventory, not a full SDK/account audit.
+
+Add the public project configuration, opt-in masked Clarity loader, six allowlisted event types, voluntarily submitted feedback, authenticated same-origin ingestion, an isolated Neon schema and aggregate-import/retention/export tooling. Add an environment-specific Release Center switch and a server emergency kill switch. Preserve the existing Oracle request/stream contract, scientific data and previous UI fixes.
+
+The initial product model and plan in this folder document the intended slice. Runtime code/tests and the migration are the executable contract. No billing, account traits, user identities, keystrokes, automatic model training or arbitrary user-content tracking are added.
+
+Publication and live Clarity dashboard verification remain distinct from local code validation. See platform_docs/USER_RESEARCH_CLARITY.md for verified activation status and operations.
